{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/extras/9694a0142ff8ef10f4d987cb72e2c38d.poster.avif?t=1770623165\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/extras/9694a0142ff8ef10f4d987cb72e2c38d.webm?t=1770623165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/extras/9694a0142ff8ef10f4d987cb72e2c38d.mp4?t=1770623165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Last Spaceship</i> is an adventure puzzle game set in a post-apocalyptic world. Humanity's final ship, the <i>N\u00fcwa Ship</i>, has crashed in a desert. The maintenance robot &quot;Traveler&quot; arduously traverses half the globe to reach the shipwreck, where it meets the vessel's smart core, a little robot named &quot;Gee-Gee.&quot; With Gee-Gee's help, the Traveler explores all compartments of the ship, collects intriguing &quot;Human Legacy&quot; items, solves mind-bending puzzles, and gradually repairs the ship, experiencing a gripping tale of war, extinction, rescue, and fateful decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, will this ship sail towards the sea of stars?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/extras/784db70b7858183c622af5bffb245580.poster.avif?t=1770623165\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/extras/784db70b7858183c622af5bffb245580.webm?t=1770623165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/extras/784db70b7858183c622af5bffb245580.mp4?t=1770623165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flight and Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip the Traveler with a Jetpack to fly freely and swiftly explore every compartment of the ship. Curiosity-driven exploration is a key part of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/extras/8593bc086f4f13731956e00bab0493db.poster.avif?t=1770623165\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/extras/8593bc086f4f13731956e00bab0493db.webm?t=1770623165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/extras/8593bc086f4f13731956e00bab0493db.mp4?t=1770623165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner of the ship hides clever puzzles. Use your wits to solve them and ultimately save the crashed vessel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/extras/3dcac4c853f10c4cffbe27b347c937c9.poster.avif?t=1770623165\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/extras/3dcac4c853f10c4cffbe27b347c937c9.webm?t=1770623165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/extras/3dcac4c853f10c4cffbe27b347c937c9.mp4?t=1770623165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story and Companions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey of exploration and puzzle-solving, don't forget the friend who travels with you and the stories you encounter along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3920780?t=1770623165","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/dbe0c4fa95f5fdc03a49f8b0fdc5814114073799/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770623165","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/cb2dfba7e932757bbfcd3a8ca3d6d0501b3e757b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770623165","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/cb2dfba7e932757bbfcd3a8ca3d6d0501b3e757b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770623165","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4378990,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/extras/9694a0142ff8ef10f4d987cb72e2c38d.poster.avif?t=1770623165\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/extras/9694a0142ff8ef10f4d987cb72e2c38d.webm?t=1770623165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/extras/9694a0142ff8ef10f4d987cb72e2c38d.mp4?t=1770623165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Last Spaceship</i> is an adventure puzzle game set in a post-apocalyptic world. Humanity's final ship, the <i>N\u00fcwa Ship</i>, has crashed in a desert. The maintenance robot &quot;Traveler&quot; arduously traverses half the globe to reach the shipwreck, where it meets the vessel's smart core, a little robot named &quot;Gee-Gee.&quot; With Gee-Gee's help, the Traveler explores all compartments of the ship, collects intriguing &quot;Human Legacy&quot; items, solves mind-bending puzzles, and gradually repairs the ship, experiencing a gripping tale of war, extinction, rescue, and fateful decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, will this ship sail towards the sea of stars?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/extras/784db70b7858183c622af5bffb245580.poster.avif?t=1770623165\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/extras/784db70b7858183c622af5bffb245580.webm?t=1770623165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/extras/784db70b7858183c622af5bffb245580.mp4?t=1770623165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flight and Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip the Traveler with a Jetpack to fly freely and swiftly explore every compartment of the ship. Curiosity-driven exploration is a key part of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/extras/8593bc086f4f13731956e00bab0493db.poster.avif?t=1770623165\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/extras/8593bc086f4f13731956e00bab0493db.webm?t=1770623165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/extras/8593bc086f4f13731956e00bab0493db.mp4?t=1770623165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner of the ship hides clever puzzles. Use your wits to solve them and ultimately save the crashed vessel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/extras/3dcac4c853f10c4cffbe27b347c937c9.poster.avif?t=1770623165\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/extras/3dcac4c853f10c4cffbe27b347c937c9.webm?t=1770623165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/extras/3dcac4c853f10c4cffbe27b347c937c9.mp4?t=1770623165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story and Companions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey of exploration and puzzle-solving, don't forget the friend who travels with you and the stories you encounter along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["\u6b63\u5e38\u6e38\u620f"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920780/cf2a650674ab5c04bf42e48155a9e37e8861dccd/header.jpg?t=1770623165","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3920780/1245052374/2254ca1053d662eb3c976534c334879eb9e35102/1